From: kevinbrar2024 <kevinbrar2024@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 18:03:48 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Order targeted reflexive triggers with other pending triggers
 (CR 603.3b)

A targeted "when you do" reflexive trigger is queued with the abilities that
triggered during the same resolution instead of being pushed immediately, so
its controller orders them together; targets are chosen as it is placed.

Co-Authored-By: Devin AI <158243242+devin-ai-integration[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>
